OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with  
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, locally heavy,      
OL,7,Facross parts of Devon. The rain        
OL,8,Fgradually easing overnight, becoming   
OL,9,Flight and patchy. Drier conditions     
OL,10,Fwith some clearer spells developing in 
OL,11,Fthe far west of Cornwall. Breezy in    
OL,12,Fthe west, especially on coasts.        
OL,14,CMonday:FCold and cloudy in the morning 
OL,15,Fwith light patches of rain for Dorset  
OL,16,Fand Somerset. During the afternoon it  
OL,17,Fwill become breezy, and further rain   
OL,18,Fwill arrive in the southwest.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
